<title>SWITZERLAND: Opel says in cooperation talks with Avtovaz.</title>
<headline>Opel says in cooperation talks with Avtovaz.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Motors unit Adam Opel AG said it was holding talks with Russia's  Avtovaz on prospects for long-term cooperation that could include the joint development and adaptation of an Opel vehicle for the Russian market.</p>
</text>
